{"id":"u-792df376-5bd4-4ed0-be10-fb16f452e903","src":"community","title":"Executive Athlete System","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/o2RRLE-executive-athlete-program","desc":"The Executive Athlete System is a 12-week performance-driven training system designed for busy professionals, former athletes, and anyone seeking to build an athletic physique while improving long-term health and resilience.\n\nThis program emphasizes body recomposition by preserving and building lean muscle mass while reducing body fat through a structured three-day-per-week training schedule. Each workout combines explosive power development, foundational strength training, hypertrophy, unilateral stability, core training, and conditioning to maximize return on time invested.\n\nRather than following a traditional bodybuilding split, this program develops complete athleticism—strength, mobility, work capacity, cardiovascular fitness, and joint durability—while remaining sustainable for professionals balancing demanding careers and family responsibilities.\n\nEvery training session concludes with Zone 2 incline walking to improve cardiovascular health, mitochondrial function, recovery, and fat loss without compromising strength or muscle retention.\n\nThe program follows progressive overload principles using double progression, allowing lifters to steadily increase performance while minimizing injury risk. Planned recovery and sensible training volumes ensure consistent progress over the full 12-week block.\n\nIdeal for intermediate and advanced lifters, this system is built around the philosophy that training should enhance every aspect of life—not simply improve aesthetics. The goal is to develop an individual who is lean, strong, athletic, healthy, and capable of performing at a high level both inside and outside the gym.","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Athletics"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":8,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2